      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ResolveCareCircleAccess also reads AuthRepository and UserProfileRepository (the role). Planning and the Overview reach\nResolveSectionAccess through ObserveCarePlanning. These only decide what the UI shows; firestore.rules are the real gate.\nCaregiverModeViewModel follows the access to the chosen patient: once they remove the caregiver, the app opens Whose care.",
